(window.BOOK_MODULES = window.BOOK_MODULES || {})[16] = {"n": 16, "title": "Verb Inflection and Fixed Endings", "ar": "إِعْرَابُ الفِعْلِ وَبِنَاؤُهُ", "lessons": [{"key": "0", "title": "Introduction", "short": "Introduction", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L0-s1\">Before you begin</h2><p>For each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>, ask <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما صيغته؟ ما عامله؟ ما فاعله؟ أمعرب هو أم مبني؟ ما علامته؟ وهل له محل؟</span></b> Identify the construction before interpreting the last letter.</p><p>Recall <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض، مضارع، أمر، فاعل، مفعول به، مبتدأ، خبر، ضمير بارز، ضمير مستتر</span></b>. A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span></b> such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنْ</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>; a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span></b> such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا الناهية</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> free of both has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنْ</span></b> is different from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنَّ</span></b>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ الشرطية</span></b> is different from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنَّ</span></b>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب لفظي</span></b> has an expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب تقديري</span></b> has an unexpressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> on a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب محلّي</span></b> identifies the grammatical place of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>. A fixed-looking spelling alone does not prove <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>. Keep <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالضمة</span></b> distinct from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم</span></b>.</p><p>Each question or table row has one correct answer. Use the analysis specified, predict the answer before inspecting the options, and check the reason as well as the choice. Later practice gradually removes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضبط</span> and English support.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L0-s1", "title": "Before you begin"}], "items": []}, {"key": "1", "title": "Recognise the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة</span> and the attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>", "short": "Lesson 1", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s1\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامات</span> before labels</h2><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامات إعراب الفعل</span> fall into three groups: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركة</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة، فتحة</span>), <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>), and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف الحركة، حذف حرف العلة، حذف نون الإعراب</span>). <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف الحركة</span></b> leaves <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span>. There is no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> as a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة إعراب للفعل</span>.</p><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامات بناء الفعل</span> use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمّ، فتح</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span></b> of the same three kinds. The same appearance can therefore have different explanations: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يكتبْ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبْ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> heard in a form such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">آتِ</span></b> is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغ الماضي</span></h2><p>Use the model <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَعَلَ</span> to recognise the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> pattern; actual <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span> have their own internal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صرف</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Group</th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغ</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مستتر</span> when no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span> supplies the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو فَعَلَ؛ هي فَعَلَتْ</span></td></tr><tr><td>With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير ساكن</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما فَعَلَا؛ هم فَعَلُوا؛ هما فَعَلَتَا</span></td></tr><tr><td>With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير متحرّك</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنّ فَعَلْنَ؛ أنتَ فَعَلْتَ؛ أنتما فَعَلْتُمَا؛ أنتم فَعَلْتُمْ؛ أنتِ فَعَلْتِ؛ أنتما فَعَلْتُمَا؛ أنتنّ فَعَلْتُنَّ؛ أنا فَعَلْتُ؛ نحن فَعَلْنَا</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلتْ وفعلتا</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة التأنيث</span></b>, not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلتا, الألف</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span> itself is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s3\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغ المضارع والأمر</span></h2><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضارع</span></th><th>What to identify</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَفْعَلُ، تَفْعَلُ، أَفْعَلُ، نَفْعَلُ</span></td><td>The ordinary forms which can have a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر: هو، هي أو أنت، أنا، نحن</span> according to context</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَفْعَلَانِ، تَفْعَلَانِ، يَفْعَلُونَ، تَفْعَلُونَ، تَفْعَلِينَ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة؛ الألف، الواو</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المخاطبة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>; the final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَفْعَلْنَ، تَفْعَلْنَ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span> itself is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغ الأمر</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">افْعَلْ</span></b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر تقديره أنت؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">افْعَلَا، افْعَلُوا، افْعَلِي</span></b> with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بارز</span> other than <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">افْعَلْنَ</span></b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يفعلن</span> is not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يفعلون</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبتانِ كَتَبَتَا</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">The two students wrote.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبتان</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع بالألف لأنه مثنّى</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على الفتح؛ التاء للتأنيث لا محل لها؛ الألف ضمير في محل رفع فاعل يعود إلى الطالبتين</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مع فاعله جملة في محل رفع خبر</span>. Do not identify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span> as a second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة</span></b> = a formed pattern; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثبوت</span></b> = retention; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span></b> = removal.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L1-s1", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامات</span> before labels"}, {"id": "L1-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغ الماضي</span>"}, {"id": "L1-s3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغ المضارع والأمر</span>"}, {"id": "L1-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "1G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the final element to its function.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبون</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبْن</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتُ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>; in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبَتْ</span></b>, it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر تقديره هي</span>.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم يكتبون: النون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنّ يكتبْن: النون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة، ضمير فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنا كتبتُ: التاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث لا محل لها</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هي كتبَتْ: التاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث لا محل لها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "1G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبتان كتبتا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبتان</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع بالألف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتب</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على الفتح؛ التاء للتأنيث؛ الألف فاعل يعود إلى الطالبتين. الجملة الفعلية في محل رفع خبر</span>. There is one <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>, not both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الألف</span>.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبتان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع بالألف لأنه مثنّى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل لكتبتا مقدّم في التحليل المطلوب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتب في كتبتا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة التأنيث لا ضمير</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ثان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الألف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة نصب الفعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتا مع فاعله</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل رفع خبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مفرد</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "1I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the group consisting entirely of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span> patterns.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحفظان، تحفظون، تحفظين</span></b> match <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يفعلان، تفعلون، تفعلين</span>. The other groups include ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> forms, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي, الأمر</span>, or a form with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حفظتُ، احفظْ، يحفظْنَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحفظان، تحفظون، تحفظين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحفظ، أحفظ، نحفظ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "1I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتنّ احفظْنَ</span></b>, what is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">احفظن</span>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>. The expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتنّ</span> makes the intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مخاطبات</span> clear; do not treat this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون علامة رفع وليست ضميرًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مستتر تقديره أنتَ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "1R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why can <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يكتبْ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبْ</span></b> have the same final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span> but different analyses?", "sol": "<p>Identify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> first. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span></b> governs the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتب</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر بالصيغة</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على السكون</span>. A visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> alone is insufficient.</p>", "group": "1R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["The first is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم</span>; the second is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر مبني</span> in the chosen account.", "Every final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span> means <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "1-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء في فعلتْ وفعلتا علامة التأنيث لا ضمير</span>.</b> Which conclusion follows for <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما سمعتا</span></b>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سمعتا</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع فاعل. التاء</span> marks <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث</span> and has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>. A non-<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير تاء</span> does not remove the need to identify the actual <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الألف فاعل والتاء للتأنيث</span>.", "There is no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span> is not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء فاعل والألف مفعول به</span>."], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإعراب اللفظي</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحيح الآخر</span>", "short": "Lesson 2", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s1\">Establish the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span></h2><p>The ordinary <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع صحيح الآخر</span></b> has <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة للرفع، فتحة للنصب، حذف الحركة للجزم</span></b>. This applies whether its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر</span> or a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظاهر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحيح الآخر</span></b> means that the last original letter is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف علة</span>; do not judge it from an attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Construction</th><th>Analysis of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتب</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبُ خالدٌ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالضمة الظاهرة لخلوّه من الناصب والجازم</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يكتبَ خالدٌ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بلن بالفتحة الظاهرة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يكتبْ خالدٌ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بلم بحذف الحركة، أي بالسكون</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ن</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكتبُ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف المضارعة</span> at the beginning. It is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span> and is not removed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم نكتبْ</span></b>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن أتركَ الكتابَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I will not leave the book.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي ونصب؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أترك</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع منصوب بلن بالفتحة الظاهرة، فاعله ضمير مستتر تقديره أنا؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>. There is no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء فاعل</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أترك</span>: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> belongs to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> itself.</p><p>Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم أتركْهُ</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span> is on the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كاف</span> before it. Identify the end of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> rather than the last character of the entire written word.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالٍ من</span></b> = free of; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظاهر</span></b> = expressed; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">آخره</span></b> = its end.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L2-s1", "title": "Establish the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>"}, {"id": "L2-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "2G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> for each form of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتب</span>.", "sol": "<p>The same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحيح الآخر</span> changes according to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبُ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع بالضمة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يكتبَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب بالفتحة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يكتبْ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم بحذف الحركة</span>. These are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبُ خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالضمة لخلوّه من الناصب والجازم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بالضمة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يكتبَ خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بلن بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بلن</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يكتبْ خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بلم بحذف الحركة، أي السكون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بلم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "2G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن أتركَ الكتابَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي ونصب؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أتركَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب بالفتحة، فاعله مستتر تقديره أنا؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أترك</span> is part of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء الفاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي ونصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط جازم</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أترك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني على الفتح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب بالفتحة الظاهرة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل أترك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء في أترك</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر تقديره أنا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "2I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم نفتح... البابَ</span></b> with the correct form.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم نفتحْ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بالسكون</span>. The initial <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف المضارعة</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>; it stays and indicates the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحن</span> form.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفتحَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحْ، بحذف النون الأولى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفتحْ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "2I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Analyse the ending of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم أحفظْهُ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>Separate the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> from the attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحفظْ</span> + <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هُ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span> is marked on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الظاء. الهاء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل نصب مفعول به</span> and does not determine the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> ending.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "opts": ["The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الهاء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة رفع أحفظ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحفظ مجزوم بالسكون على الظاء؛ الهاء مفعول به</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحفظ مجرور بالكسرة المقدّرة</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "2R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أريدُ أن أفهم... الدرسَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن</span></b> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفهمَ</span></b>, so the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحيح الآخر</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة ظاهرة</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أريد</span> does not extend across <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن</span> to the following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>.</p>", "group": "2R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفهمُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفهمَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفهمْ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "2-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزمه بحذف الحركة</span>.</b> What does this mean for <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يجلسْ</span></b>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجلسْ</span></b> retains all its letters; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف الحركة، أي السكون</span>. Distinguish this from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف حرف العلة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف نون الإعراب</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["The initial <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المضارعة</span> is removed.", "The whole final letter <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سين</span> is removed.", "The final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركة</span> is removed, leaving <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">السين</span>."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>", "short": "Lesson 3", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s1\">Five patterns, not five vocabulary words</h2><p>Any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> on <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يفعلان، تفعلان، يفعلون، تفعلون، تفعلين</span></b> belongs to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بثبوت نون الإعراب</span></b>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span> are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بحذف نون الإعراب</span></b>.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبانِ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن تكتبا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم تكتبا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبونَ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يكتبوا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يكتبوا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبينَ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن تكتبي</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم تكتبي</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المخاطبة</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Removing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span> does not remove the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبوا</span>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> remains a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> and the following written <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين</span>. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبي</span>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المخاطبة</span>, not the last original letter of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتب</span>.</p><p>A weak original ending does not override this pattern: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتم تدعونَ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن تدعوا</span></b> still has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب بحذف النون</span>, because this is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span> construction. Later we will distinguish it from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو يدعو</span></b>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم تكتبوا الرسالةَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">You did not write the letter.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي وجزم؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبوا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بلم وعلامة جزمه حذف النون لأنه من الأفعال الخمسة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الألف</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعد الواو: لا محل لها؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالة</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>. There is no hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> replacing the expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span>.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span></b> names the retained or removed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>, not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L3-s1", "title": "Five patterns, not five vocabulary words"}, {"id": "L3-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "3G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the ending to the requested <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>.", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف، واو</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمائر فاعل</span> in these forms. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span></b> is retained for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> and removed for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>. Do not remove the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> instead.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتما تكتبان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بثبوت النون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالألف</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتم لن تكتبوا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بالسكون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بحذف النون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بحذف واو الجماعة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتِ لم تكتبي</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بحذف النون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالياء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بحذف الياء</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "3G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم تكتبوا الرسالةَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجزم</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبوا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بحذف النون؛ الواو فاعل، والألف بعدها لا محل لها؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالةَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>. The omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>, not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي ونصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي وجزم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبوا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بحذف النون لأنه من الأفعال الخمسة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بحذف الواو</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة رفع الفعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الألف بعد الواو</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ثان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف مكتوبة لا محل لها، وليست ألف الاثنين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة نصب الفعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "3I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحّح</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتِ لن تهملين عملك</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تهملي</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بلن بحذف النون</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تهملين؛ ياء المخاطبة</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعلًا. تهملْن</span> would introduce <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span> and change the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مخاطب</span>.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتِ لن تهملْن عملك</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتِ لن تهملي عملك</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتِ لن تهملُ عملك</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "3I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكمل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما لم يفتح... البابَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يفتحا</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بحذف النون؛ الألف فاعل يدل على اثنين. يفتحان</span> retains the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع علامة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يفتحوا</span> changes the intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يفتحا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يفتحوا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يفتحانِ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "3R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتم لن تدعوا</span></b>, why is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة حذف النون</span> rather than <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف حرف العلة</span>?", "sol": "<p>The expressed <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتم</span></b> fixes the pattern <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تدعون</span></b>. Under <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span> it becomes <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تدعوا</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بحذف النون</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span> still <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. This differs from the ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو يدعو</span> form.</p>", "group": "3R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span> removes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.", "The form is from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تدعون</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span>, so it belongs to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span>.", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> ending in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> is automatically <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "3-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب الأفعال الخمسة وجزمها بحذف النون</span>.</b> How do you distinguish the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يكتبا</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يكتبا</span></b>?", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> determines <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> versus <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span> even though the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> is the same. In both constructions <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة الإعراب</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>; both show <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف النون</span>.", "Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوبان</span> because the spelling matches.", "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> makes both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعين</span>."], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "4", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعتلّ الآخر</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإعراب التقديري</span>", "short": "Lesson 4", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s1\">First exclude <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span></h2><p>With the ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> ending in an original <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو، ياء</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span></b>, inspect which <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف علة</span> remains. An attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مفعول به</span> does not change that classification: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يهديهِ</span></b> still comes from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يهدي</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">آخر الفعل</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو: يدعو</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يدعو: ضمة مقدّرة للثقل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يدعوَ: فتحة ظاهرة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يدعُ: حذف الواو</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء: يرمي</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يرمي: ضمة مقدّرة للثقل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يرميَ: فتحة ظاهرة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يرمِ: حذف الياء</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف: يسعى</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يسعى: ضمة مقدّرة للتعذّر</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يسعى: فتحة مقدّرة للتعذّر</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يسعَ: حذف الألف</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الثقل</span></b> prevents the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> being expressed on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> here; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التعذّر</span></b> prevents either <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span>. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>, the remaining <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة، كسرة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> before the deleted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> is not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة الجزم</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحذف</span></b> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>.</p><p>Some forms in this family have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب تقديري</span>, but not every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حالة</span> does: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يرمي</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة مقدّرة</span>, while <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يرميَ</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة ظاهرة</span>. Unchanged <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يسعى</span></b> can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعًا</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوبًا</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> decides.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يرمِ خالدٌ الكرةَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Khalid did not throw the ball.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي وجزم؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يرمِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بلم وعلامة جزمه حذف حرف العلة، أصله يرمي؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكرة</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> under <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الميم</span> is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> and not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة الجزم</span>.</p><p>Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتِ لم ترمي الكرةَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ترمي</span> is from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ترمين، مجزوم بحذف النون</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المخاطبة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. The expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مخاطبة</span> determines the construction.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف العلة</span></b> = one of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ا، و، ي</span> in this ending classification; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّرة</span></b> = required but unexpressed.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L4-s1", "title": "First exclude <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span>"}, {"id": "L4-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "4G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the analysis of each weak ending.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يدعو</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة مقدّرة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يرميَ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة ظاهرة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يسعى</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة مقدّرة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يدعُ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف حرف العلة</span>. The remaining <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يدعُ</span> is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو يدعو</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بثبوت النون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بضمة مقدّرة على الواو للثقل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو لن يرميَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بفتحة ظاهرة على الياء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بفتحة مقدّرة على الياء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بحذف النون</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو لن يسعى</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بضمة ظاهرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بفتحة مقدّرة على الألف للتعذّر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو لم يدعُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالضمة الظاهرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بحذف النون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بحذف الواو</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "4G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يرمِ خالدٌ الكرةَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجزم</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يرمِ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بحذف الياء؛ خالد فاعل مرفوع والكرة مفعول به منصوب</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الميم</span> remains after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف الياء</span>; it is not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة جر</span> or the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة الجزم</span> itself.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي وجزم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي ونصب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يرمِ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بحذف حرف العلة، أصله يرمي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجرور بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الكسر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكرة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر لم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ثان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "4I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكمل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو لم ينس... الوعدَ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">، من ينسى</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ينسَ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بحذف الألف</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ينسى</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> before the removed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> remains. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ينسِ</span> incorrectly changes that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركة</span>.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ينسى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ينسِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ينسَ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "4I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قارن</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو لم يرمِ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">و</span><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتِ لم ترمي</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما العلامتان؟</span>", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يرمِ</span></b> comes from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يرمي</span> with an original <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> removed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ترمي</span></b> comes from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ترمين</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المخاطبة</span> retained as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span> removed.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكسرة علامة جر في الجملتين</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف الياء في الجملتين</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف حرف العلة في الأولى، وحذف النون في الثانية</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "4R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why does <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو يسعى</span></b> keep the same spelling in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو لن يسعى</span></b>?", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> prevents either <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركة</span> from being expressed. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> changes the required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>, even though neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> appears visibly.</p>", "group": "4R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["The first has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة مقدّرة</span> and the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة مقدّرة</span>; both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يسعى</span> is always <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> because its spelling is unchanged.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span> does not govern any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> ending in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "4-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعتلّ بالألف تقدر فيه الضمة والفتحة</span>.</b> Which construction has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة مقدّرة</span>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يرضى</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بفتحة مقدّرة على الألف للتعذّر</span>. Bare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يرضى</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة مقدّرة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يرضَ</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم بحذف الألف</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يرضى خالدٌ، بلا ناصب أو جازم</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يرضى خالدٌ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يرضَ خالدٌ</span>."], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "5", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span> and a changing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>", "short": "Lesson 5", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s1\">The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span></h2><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضارع</span> with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span></b> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> itself is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>. It stays when a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span> enters; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> changes instead.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Construction</th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفعل</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنّ يكتبْنَ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون في محل رفع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنّ لن يكتبْنَ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون في محل نصب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنّ لم يكتبْنَ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون في محل جزم</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Do not remove <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span> by applying the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span> rule. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتِ تكتبين</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن تكتبي</span></b> with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتنّ تكتبْنَ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن تكتبْنَ</span></b>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s2\">Identical spelling can hide different constructions</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم يدعونَ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>: it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بثبوت النون</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنّ يدعونَ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>: it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون في محل رفع</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span> belonging to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دعا يدعو</span>. Consequently <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم لن يدعوا</span></b> but <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنّ لن يدعونَ</span></b>. Establish the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صرف</span> before deciding which <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> you see.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالباتُ لن يتركْنَ الدرسَ</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبات</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع بالضمة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي ونصب؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يتركن</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مبني على السكون لاتصاله بنون النسوة في محل نصب؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل يعود إلى الطالبات؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرس</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يتركن الدرس</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل رفع خبر</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> differs from the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> of the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span>.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اتّصل به</span></b> = attached to it; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">له محل</span></b> = it occupies a grammatical place.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L5-s1", "title": "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>"}, {"id": "L5-s2", "title": "Identical spelling can hide different constructions"}, {"id": "L5-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "5G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Track the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> while keeping <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span></b> is retained as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> in all three. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> stays <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنيًّا على السكون</span>; absence of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع, لن</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جزم</span>.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنّ يحفظْن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بثبوت النون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون في محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنّ لن يحفظْن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بحذف النون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون في محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بحذف حرف العلة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنّ لم يحفظْن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون بلا محل هنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بحذف النون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون في محل جزم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "5G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبات لن يتركن الدرس</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبات</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يتركن</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعد لن مبني على السكون في محل نصب ونون النسوة فاعل؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرس</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>. The whole <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يتركن الدرس</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر</span>, despite <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب</span> the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> itself.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبات</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم لن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جزم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نفي ونصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يتركن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مبني على السكون في محل نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني على الضم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب بحذف النون</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يتركن الدرس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل نصب تبعًا للفعل وحده</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل رفع خبر</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "5I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحّح مع إبقاء المخاطبات أنفسهنّ</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتنّ لن تكتبْ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>Keep <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن تكتبْنَ</span></b>. It supplies the intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> and is not removed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span>. The other choices substitute a different <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتنّ لن تكتبْنَ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتنّ لن تكتبوا</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتنّ لن تكتبي</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "5I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عيّن النون في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم يدعون</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثم</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنّ يدعون</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>. With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنّ</span></b>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> belongs to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل دعا يدعو</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون نفسها</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. Identical spelling requires context.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد في الجملتين</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة في الأولى، ونون الإعراب في الثانية</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب في الأولى، ونون النسوة في الثانية</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "5R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكمل مع هنّ</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنّ لن <span class=\"blank\"></span> لنا</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">، من يدعو</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنّ لن يدعونَ</span></b> retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span> and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون في محل نصب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يدعوا</span></b> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span> form with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span> removed; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يدعُ</span></b> is not the required pattern.</p>", "group": "5R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يدعوا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يدعونَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يدعُ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "5-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضارع مع نون النسوة مبني على السكون، والنون ضمير فاعل</span>.</b> Which statement follows?", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على السكون</span> while a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span> gives it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب</span>. Do not confuse the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> after a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> must be deleted after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف لا محل له</span>.", "A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span> can change the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> without deleting this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span>."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "6", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span> with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر</span>", "short": "Lesson 6", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s1\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الفتح</span></h2><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضارع</span> with a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مستتر</span></b> and directly attached <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span></b> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف لا محل له</span>, not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. Its two forms are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الثقيلة نَّ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الخفيفة نْ</span></b>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Example</th><th>Analysis of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واللهِ لأكتبَنَّ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح في محل رفع</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسألُه أن يكتبَنَّ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح في محل نصب بأن</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تكسلَنَّ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح في محل جزم بلا الناهية</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأكتبنّ</span></b> reinforces the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب القسم</span>; it is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الأمر</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِيكتبْ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الأمر جازمة</span> followed by a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span>. Do not infer the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> merely from the presence of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span>.</p><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تكسلَنَّ</span></b>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتح</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>, even though the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن يكتبَنَّ</span></b>, it is also <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>, although the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>. The same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتح</span> therefore does not tell you the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تُهْمِلَنَّ عملَكَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Do not neglect your work.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نهي وجزم؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تهملنّ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مبني على الفتح لاتصاله بنون التوكيد مباشرة، في محل جزم؛ فاعله ضمير مستتر تقديره أنت؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد الثقيلة</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف لا محل له؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة، وهو مضاف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مباشرة</span></b> = directly; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثقيلة</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شدة</span>, while <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خفيفة</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شدة</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L6-s1", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الفتح</span>"}, {"id": "L6-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "6G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Identify <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البناء</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المحل</span> with directly attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>.", "sol": "<p>The directly attached <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span></b> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الفتح</span> with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر</span>. The governing construction separately gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع، نصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون نفسها</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف لا محل له</span>.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">والله لأكتبنّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بثبوت نون التوكيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح في محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بلام الأمر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسأله أن يكتبنّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بفتحة ظاهرة على نون التوكيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح في محل نصب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تكسلنّ، على النهي</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح في محل جزم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بحذف نون التوكيد</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "6G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تهملنَّ عملَك</span></b> as a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نهي</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناهية جازمة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تهملنّ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح في محل جزم، فاعله مستتر أنت؛ نون التوكيد الثقيلة حرف لا محل له</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عملَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب ومضاف والكاف مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا النافية للجنس</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نهي وجزم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تهملنّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون لاتصاله بنون النسوة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مبني على الفتح في محل جزم</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل تهملنّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مستتر تقديره أنت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب، علامة رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد الثقيلة، حرف لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة، فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عملك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل فاعل مرفوع والكاف مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمل مفعول به منصوب ومضاف؛ الكاف مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "6I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قارن</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِيكتبْ خالدٌ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">و</span><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واللهِ لأكتبَنَّ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما اللام؟</span>", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِيكتبْ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الأمر</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأكتبنّ</span></b>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> reinforces <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب القسم</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> with directly attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح في محل رفع</span>.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الأمر الجازمة في الجملتين</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الأمر الجازمة في الأولى، ولام جواب القسم في الثانية</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر في الجملتين</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "6I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تتركَنَّ صديقَك</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">، على النهي، ما سبب الفتح على الكاف في تتركنّ؟</span>", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تتركَنّ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح بسبب نون التوكيد المباشرة</span>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span> because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناهية. الكاف</span> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> belongs to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ترك</span>; it is not an attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكاف ضمير في محل جر</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب بلا الناهية</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء لاتصال نون التوكيد مباشرة، مع محل جزم</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "6R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which statement correctly separates <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنّ يكتبْنَ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو ليكتبَنَّ</span></b>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span></b> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> and gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على السكون</span>. Directly attached <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span></b> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> and gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الفتح</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> in the second is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هو</span>.</p>", "group": "6R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["Both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نونات</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمائر فاعل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأولى مبنية على السكون ونونها فاعل؛ الثانية مبنية على الفتح ونونها حرف توكيد</span>.", "Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوعان بثبوت النون</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "6-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المضارع مع ضمير مستتر ونون التوكيد مبني على الفتح</span>.</b> What must be checked before applying this rule?", "sol": "<p>The rule is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرطي. نون النسوة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span> have other functions; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span> have a separating <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> present or understood and need a separate analysis.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["The identity of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> and whether the connection is direct with a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر</span>.", "Only whether the written word contains any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span>.", "Whether the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> follows a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>."], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "7", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>", "short": "Lesson 7", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s1\">A missing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> without a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span></h2><p>Do not apply the previous lesson indiscriminately to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span>. When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span> joins these forms, the separating <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> is present or understood, and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بنون الإعراب المقدّرة</span></b> in the account used here.</p><p>Compare the forms of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أطاع يُطيع</span> in a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب القسم</span>, free of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span>:</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المقصود</span></th><th>Form</th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفاعل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة الرفع</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَيُطِيعَانِّ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الألف فاعل؛ نون الإعراب مقدّرة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَيُطِيعُنَّ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة المحذوفة فاعل؛ نون الإعراب مقدّرة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لَيُطِيعَنَّ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر؛ مبني على الفتح في محل رفع</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليطيعُنّ</span></b> helps distinguish the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span> form from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليطيعَنّ</span></b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> you hear is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span> and not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s2\">What has been removed?</h2><p>In the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما</span> pattern, the underlying combination has <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span> + <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span></b> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين. نون الإعراب</span> is removed <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لاجتماع النونات</span></b>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الألف</span> remains, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد الثقيلة</span> after it has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسر</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليطيعانِّ</span></b>.</p><p>In the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span> pattern, start from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يطيعون</span></b> plus <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد. نون الإعراب</span> is removed first; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span> is then removed before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>, leaving <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> as its indication: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليطيعُنَّ</span></b>. The removed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> is still the grammatical <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. This is not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف النون</span> caused by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ أبي وأمّي لَيَدْعُوَانِّ لي</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">My father and mother certainly pray for me.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مشبّه بالفعل؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبي</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إنّ منصوب بفتحة مقدّرة قبل ياء المتكلّم، والياء مضاف إليه؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للعطف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمّي</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف منصوب بفتحة مقدّرة، والياء مضاف إليه</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للتوكيد؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يدعوانّ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع بنون الإعراب المقدّرة المحذوفة لاجتماع النونات؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الألف</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف لا محل له؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لي</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور متعلّق بيدعوانّ. الجملة الفعلية في محل رفع خبر إنّ</span>.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اجتماع النونات</span></b> = the coming together of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> sounds; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصله</span></b> introduces the underlying form before changes.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L7-s1", "title": "A missing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> without a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span>"}, {"id": "L7-s2", "title": "What has been removed?"}, {"id": "L7-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "7G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Use the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب تقديري</span> account. All examples are in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب القسم</span> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span>.", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span> forms belong to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span></b> and have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون إعراب مقدّرة</span> in this account. In the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span> form the removed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعلًا</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span> form has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر</span> and directly attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>, giving <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الفتح</span>.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما لَيُطِيعَانِّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح؛ النون فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بنون الإعراب المقدّرة؛ الألف فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بحذف الألف</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم لَيُطِيعُنَّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بنون الإعراب المقدّرة؛ الواو المحذوفة فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح مع فاعل مستتر مفرد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بحذف الواو</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو لَيُطِيعَنَّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بثبوت نون التوكيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بلام الأمر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح في محل رفع؛ الفاعل مستتر</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "7G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> analysis in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ أبي وأمّي لَيَدْعُوَانِّ لي</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يدعوانّ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بنون الإعراب المقدّرة المحذوفة لاجتماع النونات. الألف فاعل، والنون المسموعة نون التوكيد؛ لي جار ومجرور متعلق بالفعل</span>. The whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر إنّ في محل رفع</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ</span> does not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> inside it.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام أمر تجزم يدعوانّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للتوكيد، وليست لام الأمر</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يدعوانّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع بنون الإعراب المقدّرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب بحذف النون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني على الضم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الألف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة رفع الفعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف مكتوبة بلا وظيفة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون الملفوظة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد، لا نون الإعراب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لي</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة مستقلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور متعلّق بيدعوانّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به ثان</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجملة الفعلية</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع خبر إنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل جر بالإضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل نصب اسم إنّ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "7I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لماذا حذفت نون الإعراب في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما ليطيعانِّ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في جواب القسم؟</span>", "sol": "<p>The underlying form combines <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>. The omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> is still the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّرة علامة رفع</span> in this account; the question excludes a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span>.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لاجتماع النونات، لا لوجود ناصب أو جازم</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأن الألف لا يمكن أن تكون فاعلًا</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأن اللام هنا حرف نصب</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "7I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عيّن الفاعل في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم لَيُطِيعُنَّ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>The <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span></b> construction originally has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span>. After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف نون الإعراب</span>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> is also removed before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>. Its grammatical function remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعلًا</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> indicating it.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مستتر تقديره هو المفرد</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة المحذوفة، والضمة قبل النون دليل عليها</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد الثقيلة</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "7R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A learner labels every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> missing its ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزومًا</span>. Which counterexample disproves that?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليطيعانّ</span></b> loses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span> because of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اجتماع النونات</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span>. The other examples really are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزومة بلم</span>. Always identify the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبب الحذف</span>.</p>", "group": "7R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما ليطيعانِّ في جواب القسم بلا جازم: رفع بنون مقدّرة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما لم يكتبا: جزم بحذف النون</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم لم يكتبوا: جزم بحذف النون</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "7-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحذف نون الإعراب لاجتماع النونات، وقد يحذف ضمير الواو بعدها</span>.</b> Which order is described in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هم</span> pattern?", "sol": "<p>First <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span> is removed; then <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span> is removed from pronunciation in the relevant form. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> remains the understood <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف نون الإعراب أولًا، ثم حذف واو الجماعة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف الفاعل من التحليل كله</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف نون التوكيد ثم إثبات واو جديدة</span>."], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "8", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء الماضي</span> and when it has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>", "short": "Lesson 8", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s1\">Three patterns of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span></h2><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>. Identify the attached <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مرفوع</span></b> before choosing its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>; a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> attached to it is not enough to trigger these rules.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعلّق</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البناء</span></th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الضم</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَمِعُوا؛ دَعَوْا؛ رَضُوا</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مرفوع متحرّك</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">السكون</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَمِعْتُ؛ سَمِعْنَا؛ سَمِعْنَ</span></td></tr><tr><td>Neither of the above</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفتح</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَمِعَ؛ سَمِعَتْ؛ سَمِعَا؛ سَمِعَتَا</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> need not always be visible: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دعا</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتح مقدّر</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دعوا</span></b> belongs to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الضم</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضم مقدّر</span> in the altered weak form. Do not replace its classification merely because the written <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عين</span> shows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>.</p><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَمِعَتِ القرآنَ</span></b> meaning “she heard the Qur’an,” <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث</span> is moved with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> for connected pronunciation; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنيًّا على الفتح</span>. This differs from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَمِعْتِ</span></b> meaning “you, one <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مخاطبة</span>, heard”: there the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون</span>. Context and internal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضبط</span> matter.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> does not settle the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span></h2><p>An independent <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سمعَ خالدٌ</span></b> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض لا محل له</span>. With a governing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ناصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جازم</span> construction, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span> can have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب محلّي</span> while retaining <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>.</p><p>In the analytical account used here, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنْ</span></b> before a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span> gives that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من بعدِ أنْ نَزَغَ الشيطانُ</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نزغ مبني على الفتح في محل نصب بأن؛ أن</span> with its following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلام</span> gives a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مؤوّل</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جر مضاف إليه لبعد</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نزغ</span></b> = stirred up discord. Keep the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> separate from the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم المؤوّل</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ عُدْتُمْ عُدْنَا</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">If you return, we return.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط جازم؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدتم</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على السكون لاتصاله بضمير مرفوع متحرّك، في محل جزم فعل الشرط؛ التاء فاعل والميم للجمع</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدنا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على السكون لاتصاله بنا الفاعلين، في محل جزم جواب الشرط؛ نا فاعل</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم لفظي</span>.</p><p>Reading vocabulary: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في غيرهما</span></b> = in the cases other than those two; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قبلَه ناصب أو جازم</span></b> identifies a governing relationship, not merely any earlier word.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L8-s1", "title": "Three patterns of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>"}, {"id": "L8-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> does not settle the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>"}, {"id": "L8-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "8G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء الماضي</span> from its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعلّق</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سمعوا</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضم البناء؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سمعتُ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون البناء</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء الفاعل؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سمعتْ وسمعتا</span></b> have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتح البناء</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سمعتا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة رفع الفعل</span>.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سمعوا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم لاتصاله بواو الجماعة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالواو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سمعتُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون لاتصاله بتاء الفاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالضمة على التاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سمعتْ، والتاء للتأنيث</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بحذف الحركة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون لأن التاء فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سمعتا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالألف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح، والألف فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "8G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنْ عدتم عدنا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرطية جازمة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدتم</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل الشرط و</span><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدنا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جوابه، كلاهما ماض مبني على السكون في محل جزم. التاء ونا فاعلان في فعليهما، والميم علامة الجمع</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب لفظي</span>.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف شرط جازم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إنّ المشبّهة بالفعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدتم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني على السكون في محل جزم فعل الشرط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مجزوم لفظًا بالسكون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء والميم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء فاعل والميم للجمع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء للتأنيث والميم مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرفا نصب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدنا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني على السكون في محل جزم جواب الشرط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر مبني</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض منصوب بالفتحة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل نصب مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف زائد</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "8I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ أكرمَنا</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>. What is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء أكرم</span>?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمَنا</span></b> has a hidden <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل هو</span> returning to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نا في محل نصب مفعول به</span>. The rule for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span> requires a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مرفوع متحرّك</span>, not any attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على السكون لمجرد وجود نا</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على الفتح؛ نا ليست ضميرًا مرفوعًا هنا</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على الضم لأن نا تدل على جماعة</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "8I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Use the account taught for <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من بعد أنْ نزغَ الشيطانُ</span></b>. Distinguish the two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محلّان</span>.", "sol": "<p>In this account <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنْ</span></b> gives the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب</span></b> while its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتح</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>. The larger <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن نزغ الشيطان</span></b> functions as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مؤوّل</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جر مضاف إليه</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعد</span>. Do not merge the two levels.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نزغ مبني في محل نصب بأن؛ أن مع ما بعدها اسم مؤوّل في محل جر مضاف إليه لبعد</span>.", "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نزغ</span> must be identical to that of the complete <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم المؤوّل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نزغ مجرور لفظًا بمن، وأن حرف جر</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "8R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قارن</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَمِعَتِ القرآنَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمعنى هي، و</span><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَمِعْتِ القرآنَ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمعنى أنتِ</span>.", "sol": "<p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَمِعَتِ</span></b>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث</span> moves for connected pronunciation and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر هي</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَمِعْتِ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء نفسها</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون</span>.</p>", "group": "8R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجروران</span> because both have a final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>.", "Both have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث</span> and no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأول مبني على الفتح وتاؤه للتأنيث؛ الثاني مبني على السكون وتاؤه فاعل</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "8-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وعلى الفتح في غيرهما</span>.</b> In the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماضي</span> rule, which two attachments were excluded before this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الماضي</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضم</span> with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span></b> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span> with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مرفوع متحرّك</span></b>; other cases use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتح. ألف الاثنين</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث</span> belong to that remaining <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتح</span> group.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة والضمير المرفوع المتحرّك</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين وتاء التأنيث فقط</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل ضمير متصل وكل اسم ظاهر</span>."], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "9", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء الأمر</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> of larger constructions", "short": "Lesson 9", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s1\">Choose the relevant pattern</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأمر بالصيغة</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني لا محل له</span> in the analysis used here. Do not call it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزومًا</span> just because it resembles the corresponding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة البناء</span></th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحيح الآخر،</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر</span> and no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون توكيد</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">السكون</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُكْتُبْ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">السكون</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُكْتُبْنَ</span></td></tr><tr><td>Directly attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الفتح</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُكْتُبَنَّ؛ صُومَنَّ؛ حُجَّنْ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معتلّ الآخر</span> in the ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر</span> pattern</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف حرف العلة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُدْعُ؛ اِرْمِ؛ اِسْعَ؛ آتِ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين، واو الجماعة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المخاطبة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف النون</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اُكْتُبَا؛ اُكْتُبُوا؛ اُكْتُبِي</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>For the last row, compare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبان، تكتبون، تكتبين</span>: the corresponding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span> is absent in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأمر</span>. The retained <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف، واو</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبن</span></b> addressed to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتنّ, نون النسوة</span> is retained as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>.</p><p>There is another analysis treating <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأمر بالصيغة</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم</span>, derived from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِتَفْعَلْ</span></b> by removing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اللام</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف المضارعة</span>. Recognise this explanation, but use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> throughout the exercises unless another account is explicitly requested. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِيكتبْ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تكتبْ</span></b> themselves contain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارعًا مجزومًا</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبا الدرسَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Write the lesson, both of you.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر مبني على حذف النون، لا محل له؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الألف</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرس</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم تكتبا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بحذف النون</span>. Same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف</span>, different grammatical explanation.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s3\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجملة وشبه الجملة</span></h2><p>When a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>, it is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محلّي</span></b>; there is no single final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركة</span> marking the entire construction. This does not make every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> have a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ يكتبُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتب مضارع مرفوع بالضمة، فاعله مستتر؛ الجملة الفعلية في محل رفع خبر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ في البيتِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البيت مجرور بالكسرة</span> inside the expression; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الجملة في محل رفع خبر</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبْ</span></b> as a standalone <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طلب</span> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر لا محل له</span> and a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة لا محل لها</span>.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L9-s1", "title": "Choose the relevant pattern"}, {"id": "L9-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L9-s3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجملة وشبه الجملة</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "9G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر</span> to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>. Use the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> account.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبْ</span></b> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبَنّ</span></b> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتح</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ادعُ</span></b> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف الواو؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبي</span></b> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف النون</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المخاطبة</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبْن</span></b> retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span> and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون</span>.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبْ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بلم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالضمة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبَنَّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الضم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بالفتحة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ادعُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على حذف حرف العلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على حذف النون</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبي، للمخاطبة الواحدة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الكسر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على حذف النون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بحذف الياء</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبْنَ، للمخاطبات</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بثبوت النون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون ونون النسوة فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على حذف نون النسوة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "9G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبا الدرسَ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبا</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر بالصيغة مبني على حذف النون لا محل له؛ الألف فاعل؛ الدرس مفعول به منصوب</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم تكتبا</span></b>, where <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف النون</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> instead.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر مبني على حذف النون لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب بالألف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر مرفوع بثبوت الألف</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الألف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف توكيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة رفع الفعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "9I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر الأمر الصحيح للمخاطب المفرد من</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يسعى</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">، بلا نون توكيد</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسعَ</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر مبني على حذف حرف العلة، الألف</span>. The preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> remains and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر تقديره أنت</span>.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اِسْعَى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اِسْعَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اِسْعِ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "9I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد في البيتِ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">، ما إعراب البيت وشبه الجملة؟</span>", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span></b> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البيت</span> internally, giving <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر بالكسرة</span>. The entire <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في البيت</span></b> occupies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع خبر</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>. A whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> does not acquire a single final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركة</span> of its own.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البيت مرفوع لأن شبه الجملة خبر</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البيت مجرور بالكسرة؛ شبه الجملة في محل رفع خبر</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه الجملة مجرورة لفظًا بالكسرة الأخيرة نفسها</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "9R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وفق وجه البناء، قارن</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبْ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">و</span><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لِيكتبْ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتب</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على السكون</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا محل له</span> in the selected account. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليكتب</span></b> has a written <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام الأمر</span> governing a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بالسكون</span>. The alternative derivation of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأمر</span> does not replace the account specified here.</p>", "group": "9R|Cumulative review", "opts": ["The first is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span> and the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل</span>.", "Both must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزومين</span> because both end in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكون</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأول أمر بالصيغة مبني؛ الثاني مضارع مجزوم بلام الأمر</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "9-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يكون إعراب الجملة وشبه الجملة إلا محلّيًّا</span>.</b> Which inference is correct?", "sol": "<p>The statement classifies the kind of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>, not whether every construction has one. Standalone <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طلب</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبْ</span></b> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة لا محل لها</span>, while <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتب</span></b> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد يكتب</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل رفع خبر</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["When either has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>, describe its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>; this does not mean every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>.", "Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في محل رفع</span>.", "The ending of the last word always gives the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>."], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "R", "title": "Module review: choose the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>, then the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>", "short": "Module review", "html": "<div class=\"readbox\"><p>Read each complete construction before selecting an ending. Track three separate things: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>, its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>, and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> of a larger <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> where relevant. Context fixes forms that would otherwise be ambiguous without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضبط</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [], "items": [{"id": "A1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Distinguish the three <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نونات</span> and the indicated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>.", "sol": "<p>The final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> may be a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>, or a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف توكيد</span>. Identify it from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة</span> and context. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحفظين</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المخاطبة</span> and survives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف نون الإعراب</span>.</p>", "group": "A|Distinguish the relationships", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتم تحفظون: النون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتنّ تحفظْنَ: النون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف توكيد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة، فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تحفظَنَّ هذا، لمخاطب واحد: النون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة، فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد، حرف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتِ تحفظين: الياء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف علة أصلي من حفظ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المخاطبة في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة جر الفعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "A2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which analysis correctly explains <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو لم يدعُ</span></b>?", "sol": "<p>With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو</span></b>, the form is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يدعو</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يدعون. لم</span> removes the original <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span>; the preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> remains. Do not import a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span> analysis from another <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>.</p>", "group": "A|Distinguish the relationships", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع بالضمة رغم لم</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بحذف نون كانت بعد الواو</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بحذف الواو؛ الضمة الباقية ليست علامة رفع</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "A3", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواب القسم</span>, why does <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما ليطيعانِّ</span></b> differ from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو ليطيعَنَّ</span></b>?", "sol": "<p>A separating <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين</span> remains in the first, whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بنون مقدّرة</span>. The second has directly attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر</span>, so it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح في محل رفع</span>.</p>", "group": "A|Distinguish the relationships", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأول من الأفعال الخمسة وله نون إعراب مقدّرة؛ الثاني مع مستتر ونون مباشرة فمبني</span>.", "Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنيان لأن كل نون توكيد تقتضي ذلك بلا شرط</span>.", "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> in the first is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة نصب</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "B1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحّح كل تركيب مع المحافظة على الضمير المذكور</span>.", "sol": "<p>Use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تكتبي</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بحذف النون</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المخاطبة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبْن</span></b> with retained <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يرمِ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بحذف الياء الأصلية؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحفظا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بحذف النون</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف الاثنين</span>. The requested <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> prevents changing to another valid but unintended form.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and corrections", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنتِ لن تكتبين</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن تكتبوا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن تكتبي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن تكتبْن</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هنّ لم يكتبوا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يكتبْ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يكتبْن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يكتبا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو لم يرمي</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يرمِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يرميَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يرمُ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما لم يحفظان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يحفظوا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يحفظا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يحفظْن</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "B2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكمل</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسعى أن أرض... عن عملي</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">، من أَرْضَى</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن أرضى</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب بفتحة مقدّرة على الألف للتعذّر. أن</span> does not give <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جزم</span> or remove the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> in this ordinary form.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and corrections", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أرضَ، بحذف الألف بعد أن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أرضى، بفتحة مقدّرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أرضى، بضمة مقدّرة بعد أن</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "B3", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A learner sees <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَمِعُوا</span></b> and writes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالواو</span>. What is the correction?", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سمعوا</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span>, so its ending is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الضم. واو الجماعة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>, not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة إعراب</span> of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and corrections", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني على الضم؛ الواو ضمير فاعل</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع بثبوت الواو</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض منصوب بحذف النون</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "C1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خرجتُ من البيتِ. لم أنسَ كتابي. أريدُ أن أقرأَ الدرسَ</span>.</b> Identify each selected <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل, علامة</span> and relationship.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خرجت</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني على السكون والتاء فاعل؛ من البيت متعلق بخرجت</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم أنسَ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بحذف الألف وفاعله أنا؛ كتابي مفعول به منصوب بفتحة مقدّرة قبل ياء المتكلم والياء مضاف إليه</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أريد</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالضمة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن أقرأ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بأن، والفاعل أنا في كليهما؛ الدرس مفعول به. أن أقرأ الدرس يعطي اسمًا مؤوّلًا في محل نصب مفعول به لأريد</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خرجتُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني على السكون، والتاء فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مرفوع بالضمة على التاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من البيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور متعلّق بخرجت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل نصب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم أنسَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنس مبني على الفتح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم جازمة؛ أنس مجزوم بحذف الألف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم ناصبة؛ أنس منصوب بالفتحة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل أنس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر تقديره أنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابي</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب فاعل مرفوع والياء حرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب مفعول به منصوب بفتحة مقدّرة، والياء مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أريدُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع بالضمة وفاعله مستتر أنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر مبني على الضم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني على السكون</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن أقرأَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن جازمة؛ أقرأ مجزوم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن ناصبة؛ أقرأ منصوب بالفتحة وفاعله مستتر أنا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقرأ مبني على الفتح</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الدرسَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "C2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبات يكتبن الرسالة. لن يتركن العمل. أمّا الطالبان فلن يكتبا اليوم</span>.</b> The first two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمل</span> concern <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبات</span>. Choose the analyses.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبات</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ والجملة يكتبن الرسالة خبرها؛ يكتبن مبني في محل رفع، والرسالة مفعول به</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يتركن</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يحافظ على نون النسوة ويدخل محل نصب، والعمل مفعول به</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبان</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ بعد أمّا؛ الفاء رابطة؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يكتبا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بحذف النون والألف فاعل، والجملة خبر الطالبان؛ اليوم ظرف زمان منصوب</span>. Do not apply the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبان</span> pattern to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الطالبات</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بثبوت النون وواو محذوفة فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون في محل رفع، ونون النسوة فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني على السكون</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبن الرسالة بعد الطالبات</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يمكن أن تكون خبرًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل رفع خبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل نصب مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يتركن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجزوم بالسكون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على السكون في محل نصب، ونون النسوة فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بحذف النون</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يكتبا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر مبني على حذف النون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب بحذف النون والألف فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب بحذف الألف</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اليوم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل ليكتبا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون إعراب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ظرف زمان منصوب متعلّق بيكتبا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "C3", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبوا الرسالةَ، ولا تهملوا العملَ. لا تكسلَنَّ يا خالدُ</span>.</b> Supply the full <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> of the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> and compare the remaining <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span>.", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبوا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر مبني على حذف النون والواو فاعل والألف لا محل لها؛ الرسالة مفعول به. الواو التالية للعطف؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تهملوا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بحذف النون والواو فاعل، العمل مفعول به</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تكسلنّ</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح في محل جزم، فاعله مستتر أنت، والنون حرف توكيد. يا للنداء وخالد منادى مبني على الضم في محل نصب؛</span> it does not replace the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مستتر فاعل</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اكتبوا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر مبني على حذف النون لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم بحذف النون</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني على الضم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو في اكتبوا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة رفع الفعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل رفع فاعل، والألف بعدها لا محل لها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف والألف فاعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الرسالة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو قبل لا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تهملوا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا ناهية؛ مضارع مجزوم بحذف النون والواو فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل أمر مبني على الضم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا نافية؛ فعل مرفوع بثبوت النون</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العمل</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر لا النافية للجنس</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تكسلنّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مبني على الفتح في محل جزم، وفاعله مستتر أنت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب بالفتحة ونونه فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني على السكون</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا حرف جر وخالد مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد فاعل ظاهر لتكسلنّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يا حرف نداء؛ خالد منادى مبني على الضم في محل نصب</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "D1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تدخل الكسرة الفعل</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في باب علامات الإعراب. اختر الفهم الصحيح</span>.", "sol": "<p>The statement concerns <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامات إعراب الفعل</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يرمِ</span></b>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف الياء</span>; the remaining <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> does not create <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>. Internal or incidental <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركات</span> must not be mistaken for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>.</p>", "group": "D|Read Arabic grammatical language", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس للفعل جر بالكسرة؛ كسرة الميم في لم يرمِ ليست علامة جر</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يرمِ اسم</span> because its last expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>.", "No <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> can ever contain a pronounced <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> anywhere."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "D2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإعراب المحلّي للفعل لا يكون إلا في المبني</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ تحليل يوافق ذلك؟</span>", "sol": "<p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدتم</span></b> retains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> and occupies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جزم</span> under <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن الشرطية</span>. The ordinary <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يكتبْ ويرميَ</span></b> in the other options are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معربان</span> with expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنيان</span>.</p>", "group": "D|Read Arabic grammatical language", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لم يكتبْ: يكتب مبني لمجرد السكون</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن عدتم: عدتم ماض مبني على السكون في محل جزم</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لن يرميَ: يرمي مبني لمجرد الفتحة</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "D3", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ميّز إعراب الكلمة من إعراب التركيب الأكبر</span>.", "sol": "<p>In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد يكتب</span>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع لفظي بالضمة</span>, while the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع خبر</span>. In the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن</span> + <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض</span> account, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نزغ</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب</span>, while the larger <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مؤوّل</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جر بالإضافة</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعد</span>. The level being analysed determines which description is relevant.</p>", "group": "D|Read Arabic grammatical language", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد يكتب: يكتب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني على الفتح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم في محل رفع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد يكتب: يكتب مع فاعله</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل رفع خبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة مرفوعة بضمة الباء نفسها</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من بعد أن نزغ الشيطان: نزغ، وفق الوجه المقرّر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مبني في محل نصب بأن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماض مجرور بمن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع منصوب لفظًا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من بعد أن نزغ الشيطان: أن مع ما بعدها</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مؤوّل في محل جر مضاف إليه لبعد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل واحد مجزوم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع لبعد</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}], "after": "<h2 class=\"sec\">Ready to continue?</h2><p>You should be able to distinguish the three <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نونات</span>; choose the correct <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحيح الآخر، معتلّ الآخر</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span>; explain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء الماضي والمضارع والأمر</span>; and separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب لفظي، تقديري</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محلّي</span>. If the spelling alone determined your answer, revisit the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> before moving on.</p>"}], "revisit": "<ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصيغ، الضمائر</span> and the three <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نونات</span>: Lesson 1.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحيح الآخر</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span>: Lessons 2–3.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعتلّ الآخر، ظاهر</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّر</span>: Lesson 4.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون النسوة</span> and directly attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span>: Lessons 5–6.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأفعال الخمسة</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون التوكيد</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون الإعراب المقدّرة</span>: Lesson 7.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء الماضي</span> and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>: Lesson 8.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء الأمر</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجملة وشبه الجملة</span>: Lesson 9.</li></ul>"};
